<!--
  What the window shows between the tap on the icon and Flutter's first frame.

  The page's own colour rather than the default white, by day and by night
  (`values/colors.xml` and `values-night/colors.xml`), so a phone in dark mode does not flash
  white before the first frame. The logo can go in the commented-out bitmap below once a native
  splash exists to hand over to (see BACKLOG.md).
-->
